                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e1e3049-0711-3c53-8316-ccd567660517",
                        "entry_id": "72dc10b1-5e62-334c-9554-3ec8dd779f72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "wydarzenie artystyczne, w którym zdarzenia łączące lub wykorzystujące elementy rzeczywistości angażują publiczność"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bc7f34b-e8f5-41f5-8a87-57036d760e0f",
                                "sense_id": "7e1e3049-0711-3c53-8316-ccd567660517",
                                "text": "20 tysięcy kibiców przyjechało do olimpijskiego parku już godzinę przed zawodami. Alejkami wokół trasy maszerowały ludowe orkiestry, między stoiskami z hot-dogami organizowano happeningi, śpiewy i tańce"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcf4ccb3-1313-4d51-bbaa-527a25dd13ec",
                        "source_entry_id": "72dc10b1-5e62-334c-9554-3ec8dd779f72",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e1e3049-0711-3c53-8316-ccd567660517",
                        "target_lang_word": "happening",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "happening",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3cdb12a-500e-3b13-a42c-d63016e1d0ce",
                                        "entry_id": "16fe9c91-b2e2-3ea7-a53c-1dd291b0b3c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of happen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60e5d396-a504-4219-b609-ee7128e13772",
                                                "sense_id": "a3cdb12a-500e-3b13-a42c-d63016e1d0ce",
                                                "text": "From the ground, Colombo’s port does not look like much.[…] But viewed from high up in one of the growing number of skyscrapers in Sri Lanka’s capital, it is clear that something extraordinary is happening: China is creating a shipping hub just 200 miles from India’s southern tip."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "happening",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c67435a-df4c-39be-8233-7c6739ba131d",
                                        "entry_id": "0200d8a7-8049-309b-a4d6-5f6768b5db46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Busy, lively; vibrant, dynamic; fashionable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a616a90-0a29-4029-8a70-4058ae6ebcb7",
                                                "sense_id": "9c67435a-df4c-39be-8233-7c6739ba131d",
                                                "text": "“[…]San Francisco is not exactly the most happening place, you know.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "905bc0ad-1e79-4701-9e05-4393b83e83c8",
                                                "sense_id": "9c67435a-df4c-39be-8233-7c6739ba131d",
                                                "text": "When the show ends, the circular, sunken floor is one of the more happening dance clubs in town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be2c0f66-8abb-4e01-b023-b735088d88a3",
                                                "sense_id": "9c67435a-df4c-39be-8233-7c6739ba131d",
                                                "text": "They're a little noisy if you open your balcony door but otherwise offer a glimpse of one of Disney World's more happening places."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a41d635-f514-3ce0-a922-cb875e5e9bf4",
                                        "entry_id": "0200d8a7-8049-309b-a4d6-5f6768b5db46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trendy, up-to-the-minute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9a9c527-b2c4-4cd0-8d86-ef6593e5bb22",
                                                "sense_id": "0a41d635-f514-3ce0-a922-cb875e5e9bf4",
                                                "text": "Every show has its hottest, most happening trends. If I were to isolate just one for hardware and one for software, this year's hot hardware would be the 386 machines, and the happening software would be desktop publishing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f607b114-c080-4c45-8ad6-70f61550528e",
                                                "sense_id": "0a41d635-f514-3ce0-a922-cb875e5e9bf4",
                                                "text": "Going strong since 2006, this ephemeral nightclub (it's open only for 50 nights each year, in July and August) has become the hottest ticket in DJ land, a combination of the most happening names in music and its spectacular setting at the heart of the Palais des Festivals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef58a747-4c2d-40e6-a749-9976069dc569",
                                                "sense_id": "0a41d635-f514-3ce0-a922-cb875e5e9bf4",
                                                "text": "San Antonio is the newest, tiniest, and most “happening” wine appellation in Chile, with just four boutique wineries that focus on quality, not quantity, producing fine pinot noir, sauvignon blanc, and syrah."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "happening",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0be6215-dc7c-3d9a-ba55-5ec2493a6454",
                                        "entry_id": "e61ccaca-e535-34b8-b0b9-4931c97bfb83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that happens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b460baff-5066-42a8-aa2f-f9e002bac742",
                                                "sense_id": "b0be6215-dc7c-3d9a-ba55-5ec2493a6454",
                                                "text": "Three follow-up singles, all ecological or religious in theme, did chart in the lower reaches of the Hot 100. Thereafter, Ocean remained a Canadian happening."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e1e7af2-631d-3f0c-b791-c4bf33fead93",
                                        "entry_id": "e61ccaca-e535-34b8-b0b9-4931c97bfb83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spontaneous or improvised event, especially one that involves audience participation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "110cfe47-a8ec-4183-9837-b10364659e0f",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1e7af2-631d-3f0c-b791-c4bf33fead93",
                                                "text": "And it was some kind of happening / Some kind of happening / Salvador Dali's garden party"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a483f587-99ff-4eee-89ac-3d17104db48d",
                        "source_entry_id": "72dc10b1-5e62-334c-9554-3ec8dd779f72",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e1e3049-0711-3c53-8316-ccd567660517",
                        "target_lang_word": "happening",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5da0620-7630-4df4-8394-5c0e7447f891",
                        "source_entry_id": "72dc10b1-5e62-334c-9554-3ec8dd779f72",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e1e3049-0711-3c53-8316-ccd567660517",
                        "target_lang_word": "happening",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "happening",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                        "entry_id": "3638c266-1a15-3781-a111-912bbc8258b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Performance, représentation, événement ou situation à caractère artistique, présenté comme un événement hors normes, original, voire unique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Audiovisuel"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3e137da-1e5f-4d72-a0bc-0d6a0d3f527a",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "Des « parties » de ce genre, dont certaines durent plusieurs jours, il y en a partout et le festival de Woodstock n'a été lui-même pendant trois jours qu'un gigantesque « happening » au cours duquel plus de 90 % des 450 000 jeunes présents ont essayé pêle-mêle tous les stupéfiants et hallucinogènes possibles et imaginables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e57858ad-b885-4110-b657-65d97cf9e162",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "Diogène Laërce rapporte l'essai du philosophe en matière de viande humaine. On ne sait s'il réussit à dépasser ses répugnances à cet égard. Toujours est-il que l'expérience, si elle eut lieu, ne fut pas transformée en habitude. Plutôt un happening en cité grecque."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34319682-7025-476c-844e-d7e8d434930f",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "Les repas prenaient maintenant des allures d’un happening permanent où la tante, jamais à court, improvisait, réalisant des tours de passe-passe avec sa cuiller, posant la gamelle du chien dans son assiette, répétant que sa mère ne serait pas contente ou boudant devant un morceau de fromage qu’elle disait empoisonné."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4d05dba-2ce6-4fe6-a18d-e3756f70bf45",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "À l’instar des happenings, des œuvres éphémères, ces bidonvilles ont la vie brève."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e5f94a8-0bc6-474f-80a3-d82378872603",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "Le Groupe donnait bien sûr ses spectacles multidisciplinaires, qu'on annonçait comme des happenings en raison des numéros humoristiques qui alternaient avec ceux, plus sérieux, de poésie, de jazz et de chansons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5a214e4-de8b-49c1-867e-3eaa9035df41",
                                                "sense_id": "3042f01c-2e8f-35cc-94c1-dd969a115ff7",
                                                "text": "Les Femen procèdent par « happenings » seins nus avec des slogans écrits sur la poitrine. Leur mouvement présente des traits organisationnels homologues à ceux d’une armée de guérilla."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
